      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "At each step, the block computes from one buffer. Meanwhile its threads load\nthe next tile, and after the compute they store it into the other buffer.\nOne sync at the end of each step is enough.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At each step, the block computes from one buffer. Meanwhile its threads load\nthe next tile, and after the compute they store it into the other buffer.\nOne sync at the end of each step is enough.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 62
    },
